---
subject: Your <%= it.appName %> verification code
preheader: Your verification code expires in a few minutes.
---
<div style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2563eb;">Verification code</div><h1 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#18181b;"><% if (it.type === 'sign-in') { %>Sign-in code<% } else if (it.type === 'forget-password') { %>Password reset code<% } else { %>Verification code<% } %></h1><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525b;"><% if (it.type === 'sign-in') { %>Use this code to sign in to <strong style="color:#18181b;"><%= it.appName %></strong>.<% } else if (it.type === 'forget-password') { %>Use this code to reset your password.<% } else { %>Use this code to verify your email address.<% } %> It expires in <strong style="color:#18181b;"><%= it.expiresInMinutes %> minute<%= it.expiresInMinutes === 1 ? '' : 's' %></strong>.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:26px 0 0;"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#f4f4f7" style="padding:22px 20px;background-color:#f4f4f7;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-radius:12px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:0.22em;color:#18181b;"><%= it.otp %></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 0;"><tr><td style="padding:12px 14px;background-color:#fafafa;border-left:3px solid #d4d4d8;border-radius:4px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">Never share this code. <%= it.appName %> will never ask you for it by email, phone or chat. If you didn&#39;t request it, ignore this message.</td></tr></table>
===TEXT===
Your <%= it.appName %> verification code

Use this code to
<% if (it.type === 'sign-in') { %>sign in to <%= it.appName %><% } else if (it.type === 'forget-password') { %>reset your password<% } else { %>verify your email address<% } %>.
It expires in <%= it.expiresInMinutes %> minute(s).

  <%= it.otp %>

Never share this code. If you didn't request it, ignore this message.
